 "exploration.bamboo_pass.start.text": "晨雾笼罩着竹隘。山道在此分成三路：一条是古旧的官道，一条沿着溪水，还有一条攀向山脊。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.start.old_road": "沿古道前行",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.start.stream": "溪边搜寻",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.start.ridge": "攀上山脊",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.old_road.text": "古道上车辙深陷，路边一位行脚信使正坐着歇息，似乎在打量你。更远处，泥地里有杂乱的脚印。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.old_road.greet": "上前搭话",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.old_road.tracks": "追踪脚印",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.old_road.tracks.success": "你辨出这些脚印属于一队携带兵刃的人。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.old_road.tracks.failure": "脚印越追越乱，你绕了半天才回到隘口。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.courier.text": "信使名叫陆沉舟，常年在山道上送信。他嫌你走得慢，却也愿意同你说上几句。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.courier.share_food": "分他一些干粮（食物1）",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.courier.travel_on": "道别继续赶路",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.stream.text": "溪水清冽，石缝间有什么东西闪了一下。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.stream.search": "翻找石缝",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.stream.search.success": "石缝里有半封被水浸过的信，还有几株草药。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.stream.search.failure": "你脚下一滑跌进溪里，耗了不少力气。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.stream.rest": "溪边歇息片刻",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.ridge.text": "山脊陡峭，山风凛冽。你一口气攀了上去，山下的景象尽收眼底。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.ridge.look_down": "俯瞰山谷",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.ridge.go_back": "折返下山",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.lookout.text": "山谷里藏着一处营地，炊烟隐约。一位书生模样的人正在崖边抄录什么，是白砚。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.lookout.map_camp": "记下营地位置",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.lookout.talk_scholar": "同书生交谈",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.camp_edge.text": "你悄悄摸到营地外沿。几名守卫懒散地靠着木桩，营中堆着不少补给。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.camp_edge.sneak": "潜入偷看",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.camp_edge.sneak.success": "你摸到一本账册，顺手取了些散银。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.camp_edge.sneak.failure": "你被守卫发现，狼狈脱身。（遭遇战将在后续阶段加入）",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.camp_edge.withdraw": "悄悄退回",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.gate.text": "隘口尽头立着一座旧关门，门楣上刻着模糊的符号。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.gate.decipher": "辨读门上符号",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.gate.pass_through": "直接穿过关门",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.end_plain.text": "你平安穿过关门，竹隘一行就此结束。山里的事，似乎还没完。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.end_wise.text": "你读懂了门上的符号：它指向营地背后的人。你带着这个秘密走出竹隘。",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass": "竹隘",
 "exploration.bamboo_pass.desc": "雾锁竹隘，三条小路通向不同的遭遇与线索。",
